    and Meta) may reduce organic traffic to our properties by embedding content directly in platform experiences. If these platforms
    adopt policies &#8212; including those relating to AI integration, advertising, privacy, monetization, or content display &#8212;
    that are counter to our strategy, our business could be materially and adversely affected.</span></td></tr>
