</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">We
are attempting to expand our Zedge Premium marketplace where professional artists, individual creators and brands offer their content
to our users. We aspire to be a popular destination that users turn to when looking for high quality digital content. If we are unsuccessful
in meeting our goal, our business may suffer resulting in diluting our value proposition, losing MAU and having lower revenues and profits.</span></p><div>

