$<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c109" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-18322">11.9</ix:nonFraction> million as discussed below in Note 7, <i>Intangible Assets, Net and Goodwill</i>.</span></p></ix:continuation><div>

