<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company&#8217;s option awards generally have a term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c203" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="ixv-18565">10</ix:nonNumeric> years from grant date, are exercisable upon vesting unless otherwise designated
